[h1]v1.2 - 1.2 Update & Tiered Pricing[/h1]

[h2]1.2 Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Updated supported_game_version to 1.2.*
[*]Verified all triggers and effects are valid in 1.2 (theocracy celibacy changes handled by character_can_marry_trigger)
[/list]

[h2]New: Tiered Marriage Options[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Marry a Prominent Noble (25 ducats)[/b] - good stats (30-75), AI will use this for old rulers
[*][b]Marry a Local Noble (10 ducats)[/b] - average stats (20-50), player only
[*][b]Marry a Minor Noble (free)[/b] - low stats (10-30), player only
[/list]
All tiers create a noble estate character matching the recipient's culture and religion. The cheaper options are not available to AI to prevent performance issues.
